# Albanian (sq_AL) draft for School Connect's app-only strings.
# Vocabulary (Albanian school terms): klasa (form group, as in klasa 7A), niveli (year group;
# Gibbon has "Grupi Vjetor"), grupi (class, a teaching group; klasa is taken), lënda (course;
# Gibbon has Kursi), ora e mësimit / mësimi (period / lesson), viti shkollor, semestri (term),
# detyrat e shtëpisë, orari (timetable), planifikuesi i mësimit (planner), regjistri i notave
# (markbook), notat (grades), stafi (staff), nxënës (student), prind, i rritur (adult), salla
# (facility), fusha e të nxënit (learning area, the Albanian curriculum term), departamenti,
# regjistrimi (enrolment), frekuentimi (attendance), mësuesi kujdestar (tutor), dëftesa (report
# card), sjellja (behaviour). Full Albanian spelling with ë and ç (Gibbon's file often drops them).
# Buttons in the imperative (Shto, Ruaj); formal "Ju". Two plural forms.

